      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1905-05-27_WidnesExaminer_art0015" n="art0015">
        <head>BABY LETTER.</head>
        <p>A BABY LETTER.</p>
        <p>Mother Feels it a Duty to Make Known What Peptolaxa Did For Her Child.</p>
        <p>a Mother's duty to make known the little girl, Clara, has derived from Peptolaza. She had been ailing for a long time, 'Lad I bad tried all sorts of iedicine recommended by friends until I was quite</p>
