      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1905-05-27_WidnesExaminer_art0018" n="art0018">
        <head>Miss Winifred</head>
        <p>Miss Winifred</p>
        <p>is Well</p>
        <p>Severe Indigestion and Pain Almost from the first dose Miss Winifred felt completely cured by Iron-O better and as she continued to take Iron Ox, her- x condition continued to improve until finally' she was rid of the pain and annoyance which Tonic Tablets—Statement to indigestion had been causing her for soi long. If it had not been for Iron-Ox Tablets, probably Miss Local Journalist. Winifred would have continued to suffor—she would</p>
        <p>Miss May Winifred, of 218, Morning-lane Hackney. London, suffered from chronic indigestion for nearly two years. She lost her colour, was weary, listless and tired. It became almost impos- sible for her to eat any food without suffering a great deal of pain. After taking Iron-Os Tablets for only a few weeks the indigestion completely disappeared and Miss Winifred is better and stronger than she has been for years. Talking with a local, Journalist, Miss Wigifred made the follow- ing statement which must be of g. eat interest to every woman who knows the sorrow and suffering that can come from indigestion. " I have suffered from indigestion more or less for the past two years" said Miss Winifred. " No one can tell the agony have had to endure, especi ally after every meal. My food s3emed to do me no good whatever. I lost allkmy colour and looked so bad that my friends used to remark how ill I looked. I felt fit for nothing except to sit about and the pain seemed to take the very life out of me. I triehl various remedies and also attended at the hospital, but only got temporary relief. A friend of mine gave me some Iron-Ox tablets which I took. The elfe3t• MIS very remarkable. I began to feel better almost at once. I continued to take Iron-Ox Tablets and the improvement continued, until, at the present moment I can truthfully say 1 am cured. Instead of being afraid to eat, I now relish my food. lam always tit for work. The dull heavy pain has left me and I feel brighter and better in every respect. In fact, Iron-Ox Tablets seem to have strengthened my whole constitution. I am glad to make this statement because I am sure a great many other people who suffer as I did would be greatly benefited if thoy were to take Iron-Os Tablets . " Miss Winifred' s case is similar to many others that we hear about every day. A low, period of suffering front Indigestion, pain . aneannoyance, weariness and weakness, various remedies tried with disappointing results and then a complete cure by Iron-0x Tonic Tablets.</p>
        <p>MISS M. WINIFRED. have continued to grow weaker and weaker. The constant strain upon her system would probably' have opened the door to serious illness. If every man and woman who suffers from Indigestion and its kindred ailments would grasp tho moral that lies behind Miss IVinifred's statement, much suffer- ing, and many serious illnesses would be prevented. A Dainty Aluminium Pocket Packet of 30 Tonic Tablets for is. If your chemist has not got them they will be sent post free for Is. by the Iron-OK Remedy Co., Ltd., 20, Cockspur-street, London, S.W.</p>
