        <p>Whilst examining a carriage on main line at Tebay a bird's nest with two eggs was found beneath the carriage above the gas pipe, The carriage is one which has been running regularly on thelngleten branch train, only resting at the week ends, so that the bird. must have travelled with the train.</p>
